This is a RAG for Reverse Engineering made using Obsidian and Langchain.

I Will *Probably* be using flask for the backend  logic.
The frontend will actually be mostly CSS. Nothing crazy. 

THIS IS A WORK IN PROGRESS

This project constitutes of two parts - a RAG for Reverse Engineering, and a chatbot. The chatbot's purpose is to help you answer any questions regarding Reverse Engineering, and even help you reverse engineer code.

However, the whole database can be downloaded (Although not just yet).